    "$fxv#1": "// CVEs that became Act now in the last hour: Act now in a Vulnder run that\n// reached the table within the hour, and in no run in the two days before.\n// Each CVE alerts once, at the first run that has it at Act now, however the\n// rule's schedule lines up with the Logic App's. It goes by ingestion time,\n// not TimeGenerated, so rows that arrive late are still counted, once.\n// Runs hourly as the \"Vulnder: new Act now CVE\" analytics rule (main.bicep\n// with sentinelRules=true).\nVulnder_CL\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(2d) and Priority == \"act\"\n| extend Ingested = ingestion_time()\n| summarize FirstAct = min(Ingested), arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by Cve\n| where FirstAct > ago(1h)\n| project TimeGenerated, Cve, CveTitle, Priority, Reasons, Exploited, KevAddedAt, KevDueDate, KnownRansomware, SsvcExploitation, RespondWithinHours, Matched, FixedVersions, Mitigation, Advisory\n",
    "streamName": "Custom-VulnderRows",
    "tableName": "Vulnder_CL",
    "metricsPublisher": "3913510d-42f4-4e42-8a64-420c390055eb"
  },
